  item('Condition in daylight',['Examine '+areas+'.','Ask about repairs/recolouring and record visible wear without scratching or applying chemicals.'],'Wear and disclosed repairs match your acceptance criteria.','Cracks, tackiness, torn stitching, corrosion or undisclosed restoration.','Editorial condition screening only. Lighting and surface treatments can conceal damage.',['%s'%ref]),
